{"4379180": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Drift", "steam_appid": 4379180, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drift is a surreal first-person exploration game focused on atmosphere, movement, and subtle discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a procedurally generated open world where landscapes change with every journey. Walk through fog-covered horizons, find structures emerging from the haze, and experience a living day and night cycle that transforms the world around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no enemies, no objectives, and no pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just movement, space, and sound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each session unfolds uniquely. Buildings emerge where none existed before. Paths appear and fade away. The world seems familiar but is never the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drift is made for players who enjoy:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric Exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liminal, dreamlike settings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing, free-flowing wandering</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quiet, introspective gameplay</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you play for ten minutes or lose yourself for hours, Drift provides a space to slow down and just be.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drift is a surreal first-person exploration game focused on atmosphere, movement, and subtle discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a procedurally generated open world where landscapes change with every journey. Walk through fog-covered horizons, find structures emerging from the haze, and experience a living day and night cycle that transforms the world around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no enemies, no objectives, and no pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just movement, space, and sound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each session unfolds uniquely. Buildings emerge where none existed before. Paths appear and fade away. The world seems familiar but is never the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drift is made for players who enjoy:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric Exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liminal, dreamlike settings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing, free-flowing wandering</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quiet, introspective gameplay</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you play for ten minutes or lose yourself for hours, Drift provides a space to slow down and just be.</p>", "short_description": "A calm, dreamlike exploration experience set in a procedurally generated world where shifting landscapes and quiet structures emerge from the haze.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Arabic, Japanese, Korean, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4379180/8791d9e23d30977e3dd4e2b1eafaaeb7f73fa0b6/header.jpg?t=1780565423", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4379180/6747904626d0336b1575927744ee3debe7cd8bf3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780565423", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4379180/6747904626d0336b1575927744ee3debe7cd8bf3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1780565423", "website": "https://www.shinobiman.com/drift.htlm", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6400 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 960 / AMD Radeon R9 380 (2GB VRAM)<br></li><